OL,3,GNEWSAHorse found with two 'teeth' in
OL,4,Aits ear seeks home
OL,5,
OL,6,FA horse which was rescued from the side
OL,7,Fof a road in Bradford was later found
OL,8,Fto have two 'teeth' growing in one of
OL,9,Fits ears.
OL,11,FKing, a Welsh pony, was found tethered
OL,12,Fand abandoned by a field worker from
OL,13,Fthe World Horse Welfare charity after
OL,14,Fconcerns about his welfare were
OL,15,Freported.
OL,17,FHe was taken Penny Farm Rescue and
OL,18,FRehoming Centre near Blackpool where
OL,19,Fthe rare condition, known medically as
OL,20,Fa dentigerous cyst, was discovered.
OL,23,APub: 05-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
